        </dl>
        <div class="fc-indicators">
          <span class="fc-indicator state-OBSERVED">Hormuz near-halted post-July 7 attacks</span>
          <span class="fc-indicator state-OBSERVED">US reimposed Iranian oil sanctions July 7</span>
          <span class="fc-indicator state-OBSERVED">MCM operations ongoing but disrupted</span>
          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">New ceasefire agreement</span>
        </div>
