        <div class="fc-probrow">
          <span class="fc-p">25%</span>
          <span class="fc-delta move-down">Δ −10pp from 35% (cold-start, 2026-05-11)</span>
          <span class="fc-horizon">→ resolves by 2026-10-27</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fc-delta-reason">Cold-start audit (52-day staleness gap; last_reasoned_at 2026-05-19). Current path: voluntary dissolution proceeding toward July 17 third reading (Legal Adviser recommendation), with October 27 as the expected election date (statutory maximum). F7 requires either a no-confidence vote or an election date earlier than Oct 27. The voluntary-dissolution-to-Oct-27 path satisfies neither condition. Updated landscape since May: Haredi legislative boycott active; Yuli Edelstein departed Likud; UTJ/Shas pushing for September (the primary YES pathway). p=0.25 reflects the Haredi-forced September scenario (~25% probability).</div>
        <dl class="fc-meta-row">
